{"4664820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Awake", "steam_appid": 4664820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4900700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664820/extras/952a60946f3c1e54509218040c6bc2e3.poster.avif?t=1787142656\" width=1170 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664820/extras/952a60946f3c1e54509218040c6bc2e3.webm?t=1787142656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664820/extras/952a60946f3c1e54509218040c6bc2e3.mp4?t=1787142656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Awake</strong> is a survival horror game where the players take the role of Mae, a high school student trapped within the nightmarish plane of <i>The Purgatory</i>. Recently moving to a new town, Mae struggles to settle into the strict religious school chosen by her parents. One day, after falling asleep in class, she wakes up to find that both her school and her town have been transformed into a horrid nightmare, where she stands between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664820/extras/a705e5fe428350cbe1d7adba693ec37e.poster.avif?t=1787142656\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664820/extras/a705e5fe428350cbe1d7adba693ec37e.webm?t=1787142656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4664820/extras/a705e5fe428350cbe1d7adba693ec37e.mp4?t=1787142656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_p